{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_bd05abd910b94a1daac291222a892953","id":"pg_5cc258a0e96d5a0cb0fcc6fae4864494","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/catatafishen-agentbridge-docs-permissions-md-124f7c082dc3-c6fae4864494.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_b0e59ce84ede5c8596d08edb7a8332d1"],"title":"catatafishen/agentbridge/docs/PERMISSIONS.md @ 124f7c082dc3","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bd05abd910b94a1daac291222a892953"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_19242d54bb7e1cdfdaef9042ca269d2d7c1ed5697ce38e39aab5664405572981"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: tests run via Gradle (./gradlew test, :plugin-core:test, :mcp-server:test, with -Dinclude.integration=true for integration tests), and the project builds two plugin ZIPs (plugin-core and plugin-experimental) via buildPlugin tasks."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2afd9d890f85af613bd60ce8a308e9b5930ea14e3d8641feeee40df233aa7d98"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"GitHub Copilot surfaces ACP resource references only as tagged-file metadata without content, so the plugin appends referenced file content as plain text after the user's message as a workaround."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5b755d2d5c4dfc5642a3599e739e4b79e063d95f4e0e5639d93e6ff5937931eb"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The bridge port is shared via a file at ~/.copilot/psi-bridge.json, which the MCP server reads to reach the in-IDE HTTP service."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8a0096434ea9902cf184244dc53bbf0f4ca0357bb2109aee4f0ea8295c34a1e6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A prolonged EDT freeze (30+ seconds) can permanently stall the JCEF off-screen renderer; defenses include an EdtFreezeRecovery heartbeat monitor and a 2-second cooldown on file-open navigations to prevent cascading VCS git log/blame operations."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9ae6b247be1606d74b118c3c7b06de7a63f3fbb1e482cb2f4141326f43baafd3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Development requires JDK 21 (Gradle JVM pinned via gradle.properties) and an installed, authenticated GitHub Copilot CLI; the Gradle wrapper JAR is not checked into the repository."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b76aa0aae8156d0a5b9ddf1a202b2192834f734a633e1001149ec94f2d921dfe"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"For Copilot, built-in file operations are denied so all writes route through IntelliJ's Document API; denied permission kinds include edit, create, read, execute, and runInTerminal, with an auto-retry prompting the agent to use write_file instead."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f0cffae3b4741825d2b7ae4b0ab69b235baf9102e1c5a22e4a31b1983a24692e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Every file write via write_file triggers document commit, import optimization, and reformatting inside a single undoable command group on the EDT."}],"claim_ids":["clm_19242d54bb7e1cdfdaef9042ca269d2d7c1ed5697ce38e39aab5664405572981","clm_2afd9d890f85af613bd60ce8a308e9b5930ea14e3d8641feeee40df233aa7d98","clm_5b755d2d5c4dfc5642a3599e739e4b79e063d95f4e0e5639d93e6ff5937931eb","clm_8a0096434ea9902cf184244dc53bbf0f4ca0357bb2109aee4f0ea8295c34a1e6","clm_9ae6b247be1606d74b118c3c7b06de7a63f3fbb1e482cb2f4141326f43baafd3","clm_b76aa0aae8156d0a5b9ddf1a202b2192834f734a633e1001149ec94f2d921dfe","clm_f0cffae3b4741825d2b7ae4b0ab69b235baf9102e1c5a22e4a31b1983a24692e"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_bd05abd910b94a1daac291222a892953","id":"pg_6821cc66651652509b419871a233d5a2","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/catatafishen-agentbridge-development-md-124f7c082dc3-9871a233d5a2.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_2c1a93c3237959a99d58abdbf4a9cf2c"],"title":"catatafishen/agentbridge/DEVELOPMENT.md @ 124f7c082dc3","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bd05abd910b94a1daac291222a892953"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_12d51da79cca6258d6bdcead0501445207a230da1473ff296b1658fc725cadfb"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The plugin communicates with agent CLIs over the Agent Client Protocol (JSON-RPC 2.0 via stdin/stdout); the MCP server JAR receives tool calls via stdio and forwards them to the PSI bridge over HTTP POST on localhost."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5b755d2d5c4dfc5642a3599e739e4b79e063d95f4e0e5639d93e6ff5937931eb"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The bridge port is shared via a file at ~/.copilot/psi-bridge.json, which the MCP server reads to reach the in-IDE HTTP service."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7339f8d9961d29657d3a874ee10528a3ccee764aa73bc3f3561efb95c4fd9cea"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"ActiveAgentManager is a project-level service that stores the active AgentProfile, owns the AbstractAgentClient, and handles client start/stop/restart/dispose."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8220283b6f24daf8fa48bee41bdffcb9db8036298ee3188d63201bfaf39d9bbc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agent clients extend AbstractAgentClient, which provides session management (create, prompt, cancel), model selection, event streaming, and connection lifecycle; ACP clients include CopilotClient, JunieClient, KiroClient, and OpenCodeClient."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b39b57cee49e9ff1b17db2ac48e16e7a2b3d66fd2da8d38db51a63fe42cb2f02"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"PsiBridgeService is a project-level HTTP server exposing 92 IntelliJ-native MCP tools; it starts on a dynamic localhost port and accesses PSI, VFS, Document API, and Git4Idea."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d790359331b940c57cec521de6257da3d43a38b8feff8d4d171fe6f4e74db636"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Tool permissions support three modes: deny (never execute), ask (prompt user for approval), and allow (execute without prompt); sensitive operations like force git push, shell commands, file deletions, and out-of-root operations always require approval."}],"claim_ids":["clm_12d51da79cca6258d6bdcead0501445207a230da1473ff296b1658fc725cadfb","clm_5b755d2d5c4dfc5642a3599e739e4b79e063d95f4e0e5639d93e6ff5937931eb","clm_7339f8d9961d29657d3a874ee10528a3ccee764aa73bc3f3561efb95c4fd9cea","clm_8220283b6f24daf8fa48bee41bdffcb9db8036298ee3188d63201bfaf39d9bbc","clm_b39b57cee49e9ff1b17db2ac48e16e7a2b3d66fd2da8d38db51a63fe42cb2f02","clm_d790359331b940c57cec521de6257da3d43a38b8feff8d4d171fe6f4e74db636"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_bd05abd910b94a1daac291222a892953","id":"pg_7ae9b7d087f9569a801b270806f32526","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/catatafishen-agentbridge-docs-architecture-md-124f7c082dc3-270806f32526.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_51f3220a2ed759aeba46239e52e7d750"],"title":"catatafishen/agentbridge/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md @ 124f7c082dc3","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bd05abd910b94a1daac291222a892953"}
